   "heading": "Mashq 4 — 2 × 2 tizmani yechish",
   "problem": "$Ax = b$ ni yeching, bunda $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 6 \\end{pmatrix}$, $b = \\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\\\ 7 \\end{pmatrix}$.",
   "steps": [
