   "Ikkinchi tenglamadan birinchisini ayirsak, $5y = 5$ hosil bo'ladi, bundan $y = 1$.",
   "Keyin, $x + 1 = 2$ tenglamadan $x = 1$ ekanligini topamiz.",
   "Shunday qilib, yechim $x = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$.",
   "Tekshirish: $A \\cdot x = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\cdot 1 + 2 \\cdot 1 \\\\ 1 \\cdot 1 + 6 \\cdot 1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\\\ 7 \\end{pmatrix} = b$."
  ],
